---Errors are output in camel case.
---@class sentry.CreateOrganizationProjectDetectorRequestConditionGroup
---@field id? number
---@field logicType sentry.CreateOrganizationProjectDetectorRequestConditionGroupLogicType|string * `any` * `any-short` * `all` * `none`
---@field conditions? sentry.CreateOrganizationProjectDetectorRequestConditionGroupConditionsList

---@alias sentry.CreateOrganizationProjectDetectorRequestConditionGroupConditionsList any[]

---* `any`
