---@class sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequest
---@field organization_id_or_slug string The ID or slug of the organization the resource belongs to.
---@field project? sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestProjectList The IDs or slugs of projects to filter by. Project slugs are unique within each organization. Omit this parameter to include all accessible projects. `-1` is also accepted to include all accessible projects. For example, the following are valid parameters: - `/?project=1234&project=56789` - `/?project=android&project=javascript-react` - `/?project=-1`
---@field environment? sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestEnvironmentList The name of environments to filter by.
---@field statsPeriod? string The period of time for the query, will override the start & end parameters, a number followed by one of: - `d` for days - `h` for hours - `m` for minutes - `s` for seconds - `w` for weeks For example, `24h`, to mean query data starting from 24 hours ago to now.
---@field start? string The start of the period of time for the query, expected in ISO-8601 format. For example, `2001-12-14T12:34:56.7890`.
---@field ["end"]? string The end of the period of time for the query, expected in ISO-8601 format. For example, `2001-12-14T12:34:56.7890`.
---@field fingerprint? number A UInt32 function fingerprint. Only valid when `dataSource=functions`.
---@field dataSource? sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestDataSource|string Source dataset to build the flamegraph from. Defaults to `functions` when `fingerprint` is set and `transactions` otherwise. * `transactions` * `profiles` * `functions` * `spans`
---@field query? string Sentry [search syntax](https://docs.sentry.io/concepts/search/) to filter the candidate profiles.
---@field expand? sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestExpandList Optional expansions. Pass `metrics` to include flamegraph metric aggregates in the response.

---@alias sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestDataSource "transactions"|"profiles"|"functions"|"spans"

---@alias sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestEnvironmentList string[]

---* `metrics`
---@alias sentry.GetOrganizationProfilingFlamegraphRequestExpandItem "metrics"

