---@field provider? string Coding agent provider (e.g., 'github_copilot'). Alternative to integration_id for user-authenticated providers.
---@field user_context? string Optional user context to append to the step prompt.
---@field repo_name? string Optional repository name for which to create the pull request. Do not pass a repository name to create pull requests in all relevant repositories.
---@field insert_index? number Block index to insert at. When provided, truncates blocks after this point for retry-from-step.
---@field referrer? string Referrer identifying where the issue fix was triggered from.

