---* `starts_with`
---* `contains`
---* `ends_with`
---* `does_not_start_with`
---* `does_not_contain`
---* `does_not_end_with`
---* `cidr`
---* `not_cidr`
---* `gt`
---* `gte`
---* `lt`
---* `lte`
---@alias sentry.UpdateACustomInboundFilterRequestConditionsItemOperator "glob"|"equals"|"starts_with"|"contains"|"ends_with"|"does_not_start_with"|"does_not_contain"|"does_not_end_with"|"cidr"|"not_cidr"|"gt"|"gte"|"lt"|"lte"

