---@field query? string|distilled.Null Filters results by using [query syntax](/product/sentry-basics/search/).
---@field widths? sentry.UpdateOrganizationDiscoverSavedQueryRequestWidthsList|distilled.Null Rendered column widths, in the same order as the query's fields.
---@field yAxis? sentry.UpdateOrganizationDiscoverSavedQueryRequestYAxisList|distilled.Null Aggregate functions to be plotted on the chart.
---@field display? string|distilled.Null Visualization type for saved query chart. Allowed values are: - default - previous - top5 - daily - dailytop5 - bar
---@field topEvents? number|distilled.Null Number of top events' timeseries to be visualized.
