---@field target_identifier? string ID of the notification target, like a Slack channel ID. Required if **service_type** is `slack` or `opsgenie`.
---@field target_display? string Name of the notification target, like a Slack channel name. Required if **service_type** is `slack` or `opsgenie`.
---@field projects? sentry.UpdateOrganizationNotificationsActionRequestProjectsList List of project IDs or slugs that the Notification Action is created for.
---@field sentry_app_id? number ID of the custom integration to notify, when the target is a Sentry app.
---@field target_type? string How the notification target is addressed.

