---@class sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequest
---@field organization_id_or_slug string The ID or slug of the organization the resource belongs to.
---@field team_id_or_slug string The ID or slug of the team the resource belongs to.
---@field schemas sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestSchemasList SCIM schema URIs identifying the request format. Must be the PatchOp schema.
---@field Operations sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsList The list of operations to perform. Valid operations are: * Renaming a team: ```json { "Operations": [{ "op": "replace", "value": { "id": 23, "displayName": "newName" } }] } ``` * Adding a member to a team: ```json { "Operations": [{ "op": "add", "path": "members", "value": [ { "value": 23, "display": "testexample@example.com" } ] }] } ``` * Removing a member from a team: ```json { "Operations": [{ "op": "remove", "path": "members[value eq "23"]" }] } ``` * Replacing an entire member set of a team: ```json { "Operations": [{ "op": "replace", "path": "members", "value": [ { "value": 23, "display": "testexample2@sentry.io" }, { "value": 24, "display": "testexample3@sentry.io" } ] }] } ```

---@class sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsItem
---@field op string
---@field value? sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsItemValueMap
---@field path? string

---@alias sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsItemValueMap { [string]: any }

---The list of operations to perform. Valid operations are:
---* Renaming a team:
---```json
---{
---    "Operations": [{
---        "op": "replace",
---        "value": {
---            "id": 23,
---            "displayName": "newName"
---        }
---    }]
---}
---```
---* Adding a member to a team:
---```json
---{
---    "Operations": [{
---        "op": "add",
---        "path": "members",
---        "value": [
---            {
---                "value": 23,
---                "display": "testexample@example.com"
---            }
---        ]
---    }]
---}
---```
---* Removing a member from a team:
---```json
---{
---    "Operations": [{
---        "op": "remove",
---        "path": "members[value eq "23"]"
---    }]
---}
---```
---* Replacing an entire member set of a team:
---```json
---{
---    "Operations": [{
---        "op": "replace",
---        "path": "members",
---        "value": [
---            {
---                "value": 23,
---                "display": "testexample2@sentry.io"
---            },
---            {
---                "value": 24,
---                "display": "testexample3@sentry.io"
---            }
---        ]
---    }]
---}
---```
---@alias sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsList sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestOperationsItem[]

---SCIM schema URIs identifying the request format. Must be the PatchOp schema.
---@alias sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupRequestSchemasList string[]

---@class sentry.UpdateOrganizationScimV2GroupResponse

