---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipRequest
---@field organization_id_or_slug string The ID or slug of the organization the resource belongs to.
---@field project_id_or_slug string The ID or slug of the project the resource belongs to. Project slugs are unique within each organization.
---@field raw? string Raw input for ownership configuration. See the [Ownership Rules Documentation](/product/issues/ownership-rules/) to learn more.
---@field fallthrough? boolean A boolean determining who to assign ownership to when an ownership rule has no match. If set to `True`, all project members are made owners. Otherwise, no owners are set.
---@field autoAssignment? string Auto-assignment settings. The available options are: - Auto Assign to Issue Owner - Auto Assign to Suspect Commits - Turn off Auto-Assignment
---@field codeownersAutoSync? boolean Set to `True` to sync issue owners with CODEOWNERS updates in a release.

---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponse
---@field schema? sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchema|distilled.Null Parsed ownership rules. Null when there are no rules
---@field raw string|distilled.Null Ownership rules as text
---@field fallthrough boolean Whether issues that match no rule are assigned to all project members
---@field dateCreated string|distilled.Null When the ownership rules were created (ISO 8601)
---@field lastUpdated string|distilled.Null When the ownership rules were last updated (ISO 8601)
---@field isActive boolean Whether the ownership rules are active
---@field autoAssignment string Auto-assignment setting: Auto Assign to Suspect Commits, Auto Assign to Issue Owner or Turn off Auto-Assignment
---@field codeownersAutoSync boolean|distilled.Null Whether CODEOWNERS files sync automatically when they change

---Parsed ownership rules. Null when there are no rules
---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchema
---@field _version number Version of the ownership rules schema
---@field rules sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesList Ownership rules, in order

---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItem
---@field matcher sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemMatcher What the rule matches
---@field owners sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemOwnersList Owners the rule assigns

---What the rule matches
---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemMatcher
---@field type string What the rule matches on, path, module, url, codeowners or tags.<key>
---@field pattern string Pattern the value is matched against

---Owner as it appears in the API response (after identifier->name rename).
---@class sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemOwnersItem
---@field type string Whether the owner is a user or a team
---@field name string Email of the user, or slug of the team
---@field id? string ID of the user or team. Only set when the owner was resolved

---Owners the rule assigns
---@alias sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemOwnersList sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItemOwnersItem[]

---Ownership rules, in order
---@alias sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesList sentry.UpdateProjectOwnershipResponseSchemaRulesItem[]

